/**
 * PANCREATIC CANCER: registry-only trial records. Every interventional phase 2, 1/2, 2/3 or 3 trial on ClinicalTrials.gov
 * that on 2026-09-24 was recruiting, not yet recruiting or enrolling by invitation (plus the phase 3 and 2/3 trials that
 * are active but closed to recruitment), names pancreatic cancer in its title or conditions, and was not already in the
 * corpus. Generated from the v2 API snapshot cached under /tmp/panc by the pancreatic deep dive (the generator is
 * /tmp/panc/gen-registry.py, a copy of the TNBC one); registry facts only, no outcomes. Trials with results and the trials
 * with UK sites that matter to the standard of care are hand-written in ./pancreatic-treatment.ts. UK sites are quoted in
 * `notes`. Linked from the glossary term `pancreatic-trials-open-today` so none is an orphan. Records link to the stage
 * or biomarker subtype page (resectable, borderline, locally advanced, metastatic, KRAS G12C, KRAS wild-type, BRCA/PALB2,
 * MSI-high) where the registry text names one, and to `pancreatic` itself only when it does not, so the cancer page stays
 * under its markup ceiling (src/app/record-fold.test.ts). Neuroendocrine-only trials are left out.
 */
